.TH ZAREAD 1  2026-08-12 "Version 2.0.0"
.SH NAME
zaread - lightweight, read-only document reader
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zaread
.RB [ -v ]
.RB [ -f ]
.RB [ -c ]
.RB [ -V ]
.RB [ -h ]
.I file
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zaread
opens PDF, EPUB, and DJVU files directly with zathura. Other supported formats are converted to PDF, cached in
.I $XDG_CACHE_HOME/zaread/
(alternatively
.IR $HOME/.cache/zared/ ),
and opened from the cached PDF. If the source file changes,
.B zaread
detects the change and automatically re-converts it.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -v
Enable verbose output.
.br
Overwrites
.B ZA_VERBOSE
and sets it to "1".
.TP
.BR -f
Force re-conversion, ignoring any cached result.
.br
Overwrites
.B ZA_FORCE
and sets it to "1".
.TP
.BR -c
Clear the conversion cache.
.TP
.BR -V
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BR -h
Show usage information and exit.

.SH ENVIRONMENT

.SS Reader
.TP
.B ZA_READER_CMD
Command used to open the resulting document.
.br
Formats:
.B PDF, EPUB, DJVU
.br
Default:
.B zathura
.TP
.B ZA_READER_ARG
Additional arguments passed to
.BR ZA_READER_CMD .

.SS Converters
.TP
.B ZA_OFFICE_CMD
Formats:
.B ODT, ODS, ODP, CSV, RTF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, DOCM, XLSM, PPTM, DOC, XLS, PPT, XLSB, PPSX, DOTX
.br 
Default:
.B soffice
.TP
.B ZA_OFFICE_ARG
Additional arguments passed to
.BR ZA_OFFICE_CMD .
.TP
.B ZA_MOBI_CMD
Formats:
.B MOBI
.br
Default:
.B ebook-convert
.TP
.B ZA_MOBI_ARG
Additional arguments passed to
.BR ZA_MOBI_CMD .
.TP
.B ZA_MD_CMD
Formats:
.B MD
.br
Default:
.B md2pdf
.TP
.B ZA_MD_ARG
Additional arguments passed to
.BR ZA_MD_CMD .
.TP
.B ZA_TYPST_CMD
Formats:
.B TYP
.br
Default:
.B typst
.TP
.B ZA_TYPST_ARG
Additional arguments passed to
.BR ZA_TYPST_CMD .
.br
Default:
.B compile

.SS Behavior
.TP
.B ZA_VERBOSE
Enable verbose output.
.br
Default:
.B 0
.TP
.B ZA_FORCE
Force re-conversion instead of using cached results.
.br
Default:
.B 0

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Usage error, missing input file, or missing dependency.
.TP
.B 2
Unsupported file format.
.TP
.B 3
Document conversion failed.
